Bind Npc 19005 Zone 21
Quest 1122 "Rebirth"
    Fulfil elsewhere
    Journal "If you complete the 3 qualifications you may be reborn through Makin"

Requires player level >= 83 and (quest 1121 is completed or quest 1720 is completed or quest 1722 is completed or quest 1723 is completed)

Rewards none

On offer
    Show quest "Are you ready? You'll have to be done with the 2nd job change. Will you incarnate now?"

On in_progress
    Say "Are you ready? You'll have to be done with the 2nd job change. Will you incarnate now?"
    Topic "For example, for the country!" do
        If player has 900579000
            Open rebirth panel
        Else
            Say "You do not qualify for reincarnation. You'll need to pass the three tests."
    Topic "No.Is left to do in this life yet." goto close
